#: privacy.cpp:97
msgid " Check all cleanup actions you would like to perform. These will be executed by pressing the button below"
msgstr "Brithwch bob weithred lanhau yr hoffech ei chyflawni. Gweithredir yr rhain drwy wasgu'r botwm isod."

#: privacy.cpp:98
msgid "Immediately performs the cleanup actions selected above"
msgstr "Gweithreda'r gweithredoedd glanhau dewiswyd uchod ar unwaith."

#: privacy.cpp:100
msgid " Clears the history of commands run through the Run Command tool on the desktop"
msgstr "Gwagia'r hanes o orchmynion a redwyd drwy'r erfyn Rhedeg Gorchymyn ar y penbwrdd."

#: privacy.cpp:101
msgid "Clears all stored cookies set by websites"
msgstr "Gwagia bob bisgïen gadwedig a osodwyd gan safweoedd."

#: privacy.cpp:102
msgid "Clears the history of visited websites"
msgstr "Mae'n glanhau'r hanes o wefannau sydd wedi cael eu gweld"

#: privacy.cpp:103
msgid "Clears the clipboard contents stored by klipper"
msgstr "Mae'n glanhau cynnwys y clipfwrdd sydd wedi'i gadw gan klipper"

#: privacy.cpp:104
msgid "Clears the temporary cache of websites visited"
msgstr "Mae'n glanhau'r gelc o wefannau wedi'i gweld"

#: privacy.cpp:105
msgid "Clears values which were entered into forms on websites"
msgstr "Gwagia gwerthoedd a roddwyd ar ffurflenni ar safweoedd"

#: privacy.cpp:106
msgid " Clears the list of recently used documents from the KDE applications menu"
msgstr "Gwagia'r restr dogfennau ddefnyddiwyd yn ddiweddar o'r ddewislen gymhwysiadau KDE"

#: privacy.cpp:107
msgid "Clears the entries from the list of recently started applications"
msgstr "Gwagia'r cofnodion o'r restr o gymhwysiadau ddechrewyd yn ddiweddar"

#: privacy.cpp:108
msgid "Clears the FavIcons cached from visited websites"
msgstr "Gwagia'r HoffEiconau a gelciwyd o safweoedd ymweledig."

#: privacy.cpp:240
msgid "Starting cleanup.."
msgstr "Dechrau glanhau..."

#: privacy.cpp:249
msgid "Clearing"
msgstr "Glanhau"

#: privacy.cpp:283
msgid "Clearing of"
msgstr "Glanhau o"

#: privacy.cpp:285
msgid "failed."
msgstr "wedi methu."

#: privacy.cpp:293
msgid "Clean up finished."
msgstr "Glanhau wedi gorffen."

#: privacy.cpp:300
msgid " The privacy module allows a user to erase traces which KDE leaves onthe system, such as command histories or browser caches."
msgstr "Galluoga'r modwl preifatrwydd i ddefnyddiwr ddileu olion y mae KDE yn gadael ar y cysawd, megis hanes gorchmynion neu gelciau porwyr."

