msgstr "Preifatwydd"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "Select None"
msgstr "Dewis Dim"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Clean Up"
msgstr "Glanhau"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "Network privacy level:"
msgstr "Lefel preifatwydd rhwydwaith:"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Isel"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Canolig"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "High"
msgstr "Uchel"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Addasiedig"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Financial Information"
msgstr "Gwybodaeth Ariannol"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid " Warn me when I visit a site that uses my financial or purchase information:"
msgstr "Rhybuddiwch fi pan ymwelaf â safwe sy'n defnyddio fy ngwybodaeth ariannol neu bryniannol:"

#: rc.cpp:14 rc.cpp:18
msgid "For marketing or advertising purposes"
msgstr "Ar gyfer marchnata neu hysbysebu"

#: rc.cpp:15 rc.cpp:19 rc.cpp:23
msgid "To share with other companies"
msgstr "I rannu â chwmnïau eraill"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Health Information"
msgstr "Gwybodaeth Iechyd"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid " Warn me when I visit a site that uses my health or medical information:"
msgstr "Rhybuddiwch fi pan ymwelaf â safwe sy'n defnyddio fy ngwybodaeth iechyd neu feddygol:"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Demographics"
msgstr "Demograffeg"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid " Warn me when I visit a site that uses my non-personally identifiable information:"
msgstr "Rhybuddiwch fi pan ymwelaf â safwe sy'n defnyddio fy ngwybodaeth annynodiadol personol:"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "To determine my interests, habits or general behavior"
msgstr "I ddarganfod fy niddordebau, fy arferion neu f'ymddygiad cyffredinol."

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid " Warn me when I visit a site that shares my personal information with other companies"
msgstr "Rhybuddiwch fi pan ymwelaf â safwe sy'n rhannu fy ngwybodaeth bersonol â chwmnïau eraill"

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid " Warn me when I visit a site that doesn't let me know what information they have about me"
msgstr "Rhybuddiwch fi pan ymwelaf â safwe sy'n gwrthod gadael i mi wybod pa wybodaeth sydd ganddynt amdanaf"

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Personal Information"
msgstr "Gwybodaeth Bersonol"

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid " Warn me when I visit a site that may contact me about other products or services:"
msgstr "Rhybuddiwch fi pan ymwelaf â safwe sy'n debygol o gysylltu â fi am gynhyrchion neu wasanaethau eraill:"

#: rc.cpp:28
msgid "Warn me when I visit a site that may use my personal information to:"
msgstr "Rhybuddiwch fi pan ymwelaf â safwe sy'n defnyddio fy ngwybodaeth bersonol ar gyfer:"

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Determine my habits, interests or general behavior"
msgstr "Darganfod fy arferion, fy niddordebau neu f'ymddygiad cyffredinol"

#: rc.cpp:30
msgid "Via telephone"
msgstr "Drwy ffôn"

#: rc.cpp:31
msgid "Via mail"
msgstr "Drwy bost"

#: rc.cpp:32
msgid "Via email"
msgstr "Drwy ebost"

#: rc.cpp:33
msgid "And do not allow me to remove my contact information"
msgstr "A sydd ddim yn caniatáu i mi waredu fy ngwybodaeth cyswllt"

